    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38437" root="مرخ" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَخَ جَسَدَهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَخَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْخٌ</span>;
(S;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مرّخهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرِيخٌ</span>; (S;)
<i>He anointed his body</i> (K) with oil (S, K) &amp;c.
(K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَخَ إِدَاوَتَهُ</span> <i>He smeared with clay his</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِدَاوَة</span> [or <i>small vessel of skin, for water,</i>] <i>in order
that its odour might become good.</i> (IAar, TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذرح</span>.)

